# Project Context

Canonical project rules live in `.agents/rules/`. Read the relevant module before making changes.

- @.agents/rules/overview.md — Stack, goals, environment modes & mobile-first philosophy
- @.agents/rules/ui.md — Beer CSS native-first, custom units (pt/px), iconography, loading states
- @.agents/rules/development.md — Strict pnpm, test/build validation, git rules (no auto-commit)
- @.agents/rules/architecture.md — App layout shell, routing, responsive navigation (≤600px vs >600px)
